{"product_id":"tegami-bachi-13","title":"Tegami Bachi 13","description":"\u003cp\u003e\"Amberground is locked in darkness. A man-made star casts only a dim light over the land. The pitch-black wilderness is infested with Gaichuu--colossal insects with metal exoskeletons. The Gaichuu make travel between the cities of Amberground extremely dangerous. But thankfully the Letter Bees, a brave corps of messengers, risk their lives in order to keep the hearts of Amberground connected\"--Page [4] of cover, v. 1. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:0 x 200  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Asada | Hiroyuki \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781421551593 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44466611683481,"sku":"Manga-A-1-9781421551593","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/3644378a2fd1f1bce4010b863a190089.jpg?v=1717778082","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/tegami-bachi-13","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}